.playwright-cli

# NEVER ship local dotenv files. Vercel injects its own environment; an uploaded
# .env is loaded by Next at runtime and SILENTLY OVERRIDES it. This exact miss
# put `OPENROUTER_MODEL=openrouter/free` — the dynamic router that lands on a
# safety classifier — back into production after the code default had been
# pinned, and 3 of 8 live turns answered "User Safety: safe" again. The judge
# panel caught it; the deploy did not.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# the docs clone and the incremental embedding cache are build inputs, not runtime
data/liara-docs
data/index/embeddings.json

# stale screenshots from an earlier review round
docs/reviews/round-001/screenshots
